{"v":4,"catch":"躲開梗圖，在混亂中生存！","desc":"歡迎來到一個現實崩壞、梗圖橫行的世界。\n\n《恐龍鱷魚大戰通通薩胡爾》是一款混亂的梗圖遊戲，你將扮演恐龍鱷魚，在這個充滿荒誕危險的世界中努力求生。\n\n你的目標很簡單——不斷躲避，活下去，因為通通薩胡爾會突然出現在你面前，讓你時刻都面臨反應和膽量的考驗。\n\n一個奇異的世界。\n\n只有恐龍鱷魚才能逃離這場混亂。\n\n這裡的一切都不公平——尤其是通通。","publisher":"Play Lab","release":"2026-03-12","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2eb797b135e5dc61723bf5571fcf0903678e602b71d7fce13adc295ae69ad84f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fbe74a1cd3af0e88df768bb9c53277fdbe51bd6ce640d0948f46277e79474c3a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3042e03de5bf300ea33c595c4dac41ef0a17abfb4d4b5e03c9a712f3815f3fd5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53d616ea8fdb4d6933bc74f6fed68ce1301b0266263b45e5f0cd42a507eb4391.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9932196b895385dbefb68873bf3e2387d740e9b9ddd225d2165f213ccae71ce0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69824fc89a4a486637cd1469b924bbbe9c3eb33f6cecb316efbe344086344ed7.jpg"],"titleId":"0100058026c1e000","dlc":[]}